id=ricoh_pop_x9u
name=OmniCam Muse
version=Muse 4.1-x8u
versionCode=301
author=local-port
description=RICOH GR, POP, X10, master colour and master filter features for PMA110 (Find X9 Ultra) and PKJ110 (Find X8 Ultra), with a settings app. Both device profiles verified: PMA110 by upstream Muse, PKJ110 by the X8U port. Device profile is detected at boot; see mount.log and bind.log. Requires a KernelSU metamodule (mountify tested) and mounts /odm files.
